  "prompt": "Cinematic, photorealistic full-body shot of a young Japanese boy transformed with the face of a Japanese demon (Oni). His features are monstrous: sharp glowing red eyes, subtle horns, and a menacing smirk. He stands in a neon-lit Tokyo street at night, legs slightly apart in a cool relaxed stance, wearing simple sandals. He now wears a flowing black and red kimono. One hand is tucked casually into the kimono pocket. His messy black hair floats slightly as if charged with power. From his back unfold enormous black feathered wings, fully spread, dramatic and imposing. The alley is the same narrow Tokyo street: glowing Japanese neon signs, wet asphalt reflecting red and blue light, faint steam rising from a drain. Gritty Akira-inspired cyberpunk atmosphere, photorealistic cinematic realism, dark 1980s Tokyo mood. --ar 9:16",
